@startuml task_reaction_snapshot
!pragma layout smetana
title Typed projection task: reaction_snapshot
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

database "The event outbox The fact of the reaction" as OUTBOX
participant "Task projector" as PROJECTOR
database "Typed tasks" as TASKS
database "Scope message\nlease + fencing" as CLAIM
participant "The worker's slot.\n(The only author of the image)" as WORKER
database "MESSAGE_REACTION_FACT" as FACTS
database "MESSAGE\nreactions + reaction_users" as MESSAGE
database "The public events repository" as EVENTS
participant "The controller . WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "The client ." as Client

OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : The fact was created/modified/deleted
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable reaction_snapshot(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=message; without coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : (project_id, canonical_message_uuid)
WORKER -> CLAIM : to get monopoly ownership exact key
WORKER -> FACTS : Read the latest facts about the message
FACTS --> WORKER : The canonical set of reactions facts
group One . DB transaction
  WORKER -> MESSAGE : I want to replace both photos atomically.
  WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready message.updated; unique derivation
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : I 'm going to get out .
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : stable ready record
DISPATCHER -> Client : Send / repeat / play

note over FACTS,MESSAGE
  Facts are the source of truth.
  API Not running a reading cycle-The change-recording JSON-The picture ..
  API The reading doesn 't aggregate facts ..
  Topic lock Not used for canonical MESSAGE snapshot.
  Lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper - They 're compulsory ..
end note

@enduml
